graph LR
    MR["model-registry<br/>(proxy + catalog + async-upload Job)"]

    %% Data stores
    MR -->|registry metadata| RegDB["MySQL 8.x / PostgreSQL"]
    MR -->|catalog store + leader lock| CatPG["PostgreSQL 17.x"]

    %% Key Go libraries
    MR -->|ORM| Gorm["gorm v1.31.2"]
    MR -->|schema migrations| Migrate["golang-migrate v4.20.1"]
    MR -->|leader election| PgLock["pglock v1.18.0"]
    MR -->|HTTP routing| Chi["go-chi v5.5.0"]
    MR -->|CLI / config| Cobra["cobra v1.10.2 / viper v1.21.0"]
    MR -->|controller framework| CR["controller-runtime v0.25.2"]
    MR -->|ISVC types| KServeLib["kserve v0.19.0"]

    %% Job dependencies
    MR -->|Python client| PyClient["model-registry py >=0.3.7"]
    MR -->|S3 transfer| Boto["boto3 1.43.118"]
    MR -->|ModelCar layering| Olot["olot 1.2.1"]
    MR -->|OCI copy| Skopeo["skopeo RPM"]
    MR -->|signing| Signing["rh-model-signing / sigstore 4.5.1 / cosign"]

    %% Internal RHOAI dependencies
    Operator["model-registry-operator"] -->|deploys image, imports ISVC controller| MR
    Dashboard["odh-dashboard<br/>model-registry module"] -->|REST via proxy, creates Jobs| MR
    MR -->|watch / patch| ISVC["KServe InferenceService"]
    CSI["KServe storage initializer"] -.->|"model-registry:// URIs (upstream cmd/csi)"| MR
    PerfData["odh-model-performance-data<br/>init container"] -->|benchmark data| MR
    MetaColl["odh-model-metadata-collection<br/>init container"] -->|default sources| MR
    AIPCC["AIPCC cpu-el9.8 base image"] -->|Job runtime base| MR

    %% External services
    MR -->|catalog source| HF["Hugging Face Hub"]
    MR -->|skill sources| Git["Git remotes"]
    MR -->|model storage| S3["S3 storage"]
    MR -->|ModelCar images| OCI["OCI registries"]
    MR -->|signing| Sigstore["Sigstore"]
    MR -->|watches, Jobs, SARs| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]
    MR -->|TLS profile, BFF| OCPAPI["OpenShift APIServer config"]

